<h3>Community Hub</h3>
<p>
  I created GhostGamedev to mix a bunch of topics that are quite remarkable and magical to me 🌌👾.
  If you find this stuff meaningful as well and would like to hang out with like-minded people
  (or just have something you'd like to share),
  consider joining the <a href="https://discord.gg/AsTYFFsab3">Discord community hub</a>! 🙂
</p>
<p>
  NOTE: There are lots of things in the Discord that aren't here.
  I've just been writing/posting in Discord a lot more often in general than here on this blog website. 👀.
  (Perhaps I just find it easier to write in Discord... Or, maybe I'm just getting lazy...)
</p>
<br />

<h3>Blog Organization</h3>
<p>
  The blog is organized by <b>time</b> (ie, the day I decided to write), and
  I more or less just write what I feel - even if that means I span multiple topics in a single post or write an entire story/narrative/discourse/etc.
</p>
<p>
  I know it's not the best organization method, but... It makes things easy for me!
  I plan to eventually organize content better, but for now, it's what I've got!
</p>
<p>
  Below you'll find the list of posts.
</p>
<p>
  Thanks for reading! 😊
</p>
